# TypeScript monorepo — Pulse

**Methodology:** [`docs/meta/ai_first_project_methodology.md`](docs/meta/ai_first_project_methodology.md)  
**Canon:** [`docs/guidelines/typescript/ai_typescript_monorepo_guidelines.md`](docs/guidelines/typescript/ai_typescript_monorepo_guidelines.md)

## Before finishing a task (after scaffold)

1. **`npm run typecheck`** (root) or `npx tsc --noEmit` in each touched workspace (`apps/web`, `@pulse/domain`, `@pulse/db`, `@pulse/policy-server`, `@pulse/policy-edge`).
2. **`npm run lint -w web`**; domain package lint when touched.

Web-only `tsc` **does not** replace package checks.

## Where types live

| Layer | Types |
|-------|--------|
| `@pulse/domain` | `UserRole`, `BookingStatus`, ports, `MutationResult`, shared Zod DTOs |
| `@pulse/policy-server` | **`PolicySessionContext` / `UserRole`**, not `next-auth` `Session` |
| `apps/web` | Auth.js augmentation, UI props, session → domain mappers |

**Forbidden in `packages/**`:** `import type { Session } from "next-auth"`, new ad-hoc mutation error shapes.

## Domain literals

- Roles/statuses from `@pulse/domain` or typed constants — no inline `"trainer"` / `"pending"`.
- Use type guards after string validation, not unsafe `as`.

